@module tables ; The tables: the lobbed shot's paths, the shards, the texts, the screen lines, the keys, the mirror and shift tables, the rooms' objects and exits
$AA00 b LobPaths 16 ; The type 7 shot's four paths: Y steps, each list ending $1E (MoveLob $B878)
$AA43 b LobPicture 4 ; The type 7 shot's picture: 4 lines $60, $90, $D0, $60
$AA47 w LobPathTable 2 ; The four paths: [start][the step repeated after the end] word pairs
$AA57 b ShardPaths 16 ; The explosion's six shards (BlowUp): 8 X, Y offset pairs each, $FF ends
$AAB7 b ShardPictures 8 ; The explosion shards' pictures, 8 bytes each (DrawShard)
$AAF7 b GameTexts 16 ; The game's text records: [attribute][column][line] text, 0
@res texts/rex2-game.bin
$AAF7 PhaseTwoText ; PHASE TWO:ENTER / THE LIVING TOWER / TO REACH ZENITH
$AB31 GameOverText ; GAME OVER
$AB3E HiScoreText ; HI:SCORE 0000000
$AB52 BioGrowthsText ; BIO GROWTHS KILLED:00000
$AB6E EndingText ; WITH THE BIG SQUIDGY / THING DESTROYED REX / CAN GO HOME AND HAVE / A NICE CUP OF TEA / AND PUT HIS FEET UP
$ABE2 PressFireText ; PRESS FIRE / TO BEGIN
$ABFE BonusTexts ; the bonus panels, 19 bytes each: SPEED UP
$AC11 ShieldLossText ; SHIELD LOSS
$AC24 BonusPointsText ; 1000 BONUS
$AC37 EnergyLossText ; ENERGY LOSS
$AC4A RapidShotsText ; 100 RAPID SHOTS
$AC5D DoubleFireText ; the flag (shown once), then DOUBLE FIRE
$AC6E LaserText ; flag, LASER
$AC79 MultipleText ; flag, MULTIPLE
$AC87 SprayText ; flag, SPRAY
$AC92 b PixelMasks 8 ; $80, $40, ... $01: a pixel's mask by X & 7
$AC9A w ScreenLineTable 8 ; The screen address of each of the 192 pixel lines
$ACCA ScreenLines ; line 24 on: the play area's 168 lines, BufferToScreen's list
$AE1A w KeyPorts 8 ; The 8 keyboard half-rows' ports, ScanKey's order
$AE2A b KeyNames 8 ; The key characters of the 40 keys in the order of KeyPorts (CAPS as "-", ENTER "+", SYMBOL "."): DEFINE and the code echo them
$AE52 b MirrorTable 16 ; Each byte with its bits reversed: DrawMirrored draws a picture facing left through it
$AF52 b ShiftFrames 8 ; The pictures' frame lists: 8 offsets each, one a pixel phase (X & 7), into a pre-shifted picture
$AF5A ShiftFrames2
$AF62 ShiftFrames3
$AF6A ShiftFrames4
$AF72 ShiftFrames5
$AF7A ShiftFrames6
$AF82 AnimFramesA ; the frames of animated characters 252-255, even passes: 32 bytes
$AFA2 AnimFramesB ; the same, odd passes
$AFC2 b RoomObjectLists 16 ; The rooms' object lists: a header [spawn sides: bit 7 top, 6 right, 5 left][spawn period][spawn kind] (ReadExits), then up to 16 records [kind][X][Y] (MakeObjects), $FF ends
@res rooms/rex2-objects.bin
$B1A7 b RoomExits 6 ; The exits of the rooms 0-25: up, right, down, left (0 none), then the word of the room's object list
@res rooms/rex2-exits.bin

